{
  "$comment": "One description of the header/footer and page-layout session ops (issue #982). See docs/architecture/session_op_descriptions.md. Argument names are the canonical wire names (the MCP name where the stdio host and MCP differ); argNames, defaults and requires on a transport are recorded divergences, not the target. Enum values are the tokens DocxSessionJson parses (case-insensitive, underscores ignored), so MCP's current_page and the wasm/npm/python currentPage are the same token.",
